The pre-constructed lexer and parser c files provided in the sys/share
directory seem to work OK for AIX 3.2.

I needed to undefine BRACES in config.h in order to compile the vision
tables.

Be careful using the install script as root.  The user "games" didn't exist
on my system, so nethack was installed setuid root instead.

Otherwise building the AIX 3.2 version went pretty smoothly for me.

